  "description": "The subtraction in COMPUTE WS-TEMP-BAL, with both cycle amounts non-zero and a negative transaction. dailytran row 1 at -919.00 against account 20 seeded from acctdata row 19 with ACCT-CURR-CYC-CREDIT 100.00 and ACCT-CURR-CYC-DEBIT 50.00: :403-405 give 100.00 - 50.00 + -919.00 = -869.00, so all three terms of the formula participate and the minus sign in front of the debit is load-bearing - swapping it would give -969.00. The result is far below the limit, so the transaction posts, ACCT-CURR-CYC-DEBIT becomes 50.00 + -919.00 = -869.00 because :551 ADDs a negative rather than subtracting, and ACCT-CURR-BAL becomes -550.00. TCATBALF is seeded with key (20,03,0001) at +250.00 so the REWRITE arm is the one that runs and its ADD crosses zero: 250.00 + -919.00 = -669.00, a negative stored in a PIC S9(09)V99 span whose overpunch carries the sign.",
